  "body": "A rare opportunity in sought-after Tainui Street – this stunning north-facing, modern home is built to last with newly painted brick and weatherboard construction (definitely NOT plaster!), offering peace of mind and elevated views. \r\n\r\nThis well designed sunny, warm, spacious four-bedroom family home is perfectly positioned on a flat freehold 453m² section enjoying a coveted seaside lifestyle. Tucked away for privacy, it's just a short stroll to arguably Auckland’s best beaches - Long Bay and Waiake Beaches and to Torbay village cafes, shops, and excellent schools - convenience meets coastal living at its finest. \r\n\r\nGround Floor – Space, Style, Sun & Flow\r\n• Designer kitchen with premium bench tops, open plan to the family/dining zone.\r\n• Separate formal living room overlooking the heated pool.\r\n• Both sunny areas flow seamlessly onto a sun-drenched outdoor patio and established fruit trees and garden – perfect for entertaining, enjoying a swim or spa, and even growing your own fruit and vegetables.\r\n• Guest bedroom (double) – ideal for extended family or a home office\r\n\r\nUpper Level – Panoramic Sea Views\r\n• Three generous double bedrooms, including the master suite with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n• All upstairs bedrooms are sunny, north facing, capturing breathtaking sea views towards Long Bay and Whangaparaoa Peninsula\r\n• On quiet evenings enjoy the soothing sound of waves crashing on the nearby shore\r\n• Spacious main bathroom\r\n\r\nHomes that tick every box are rare – this one won’t last. Act fast to secure your family’s dream coastal lifestyle.",
